<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2013/05/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>Cross.CQRS</id>
    <version>0.0.0</version>
    <authors>Denis Peshkov</authors>
    <owners>Denis Peshkov</owners>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/denis-peshkov/Cross.CQRS</projectUrl>
    <repository type="git" url="https://github.com/denis-peshkov/Cross.CQRS.git" />
    <description>Simple .NET MediatR base Query, Command, CommandEvent and CommandEventQueueProcess behavior. RequestFilter, ResultFilter and Filter behaviours. Event Queue and Validation behaviors. JWT license validation with pluggable product metadata (ILicenseProductInfo) for core and Cross.CQRS.EF. Written in C#.</description>
    <tags>.NET MediatR Query QueryHandler Command CommandHandler CommandEvent CommandEventHandler CommandEventQueueProcessBehavior Filter RequestFilter ResultFilter FilterBehavior Validation ValidationBehavior CQRS License JWT NetCore</tags>
    <icon>icon.png</icon>
    <readme>README.md</readme>
    <copyright>Copyright 2026 Denis Peshkov</copyright>
    <license type="file">LICENSE</license>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <releaseNotes><![CDATA[
Licensing and pipeline
- License validation uses ILicenseProductInfo (default LicenseProductInfo). CheckLicense runs Validate for all registered ILicenseProductInfo (extensions can register additional implementations).
- LicenseCheckBehavior order is -2; order -1 is reserved for Cross.CQRS.EF (EfLicenseCheckBehavior).
- InternalsVisibleTo Cross.CQRS.EF for shared licensing types.
Dependencies
- Per-TFM Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration / Logging: 8.0.x on netstandard2.1 and net6.0–net8.0; 9.0.14 on net9.0; 10.0.5 on net10.0.
- FluentValidation 11.12.0, MediatR 11.1.0, Microsoft.IdentityModel.JsonWebTokens 8.17.0, Scrutor 4.2.2 (unchanged).
]]></releaseNotes>
